#: templates/landing/index.html:1105
msgid ""
"Tracking appointments in a notebook or WhatsApp always leads to mistakes. "
"Two clients booked at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Отслеживание записей в тетради или WhatsApp всегда ведёт к ошибкам. Двое "
"клиентов на одно время."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1111
msgid "Clients who don't show up"
msgstr "Клиенты, которые не приходят"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1112
msgid ""
"The client forgot, didn't come. You're left with empty time you can't "
"recover. No reminder was sent."
msgstr ""
